          {
            "chunk_id": "private-rental:0:724ee7d0ea4e",
            "text": "私人住宅租赁与最短租期\n私人住宅的最低租期\n根据 URA 的私人住宅出租规则，普通私人住宅每次出租至少连续三个月。Condominium、公寓及其他普通私人住宅不能因为房东同意，就改成按天或按周出租。私人住宅租一个月、周末住宿、短期旅游住宿，都不能直接套用普通住宅的租赁方式。三个月是规则下限，不意味着每套房东都愿意签三个月；实际可接受的最短租期还要询问房东并写入租约。",
            "heading": "私人住宅的最低租期",
            "document_id": "private-rental",
            "title": "私人住宅租赁与最短租期",
            "scope": "policy_guidance",
            "revision": "2026-10-20.1",
            "checked_at": "2026-10-20",
            "review_after": "2027-01-20",
            "sources": [
              {
                "title": "URA Renting Property",
                "url": "https://www.ura.gov.sg/guidelines/property-and-business-owners/property/renting-property/"
              },
              {
                "title": "URA Short-Term Accommodation",
                "url": "https://www.ura.gov.sg/guidelines/property-and-business-owners/property/short-term-accommodation/"
              }
            ],
            "source_ref": "knowledge/rental/private-rental.md",
            "rrf_score": 0.01639344262295082,
            "vector_rank": null,
            "bm25_rank": 1,
